fts including fighters, bomber.\n20+ tanks and anti-tank vehicles.\n9 different battle maps from the Pacific to Europe.", "short_description": "This is the DEMO version of Gunship Sequel WW2 VR, a cross play combat aircraft simulation, brings realistic combat flight simulation experience to VR with realistic cockpits, carrier operations, multi-player battles, arcade/historic/realistic modes and more.\n\n50+ flyable aircrafts including fighters, bomber.\n20+ tanks and anti-tank vehicles.\n9 different battle maps from the Pacific to Europe."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://data.phanotek.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://data.phanotek.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Phanotek, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.phanotek.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "ACTION", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "26111672321812293"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1835454650126720_4478481069274995137_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wX9vikQz1yAQ7kNvwEWOGuP&_nc_oc=AdlFLinjyzH7DKiZMrTiO3CFXwbSYAH6gDgreT55ghNyRsHqpKgluaVZXJU-1hoNHNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvgSQ3dBUUzAYHn_FhRATUsh9S8jUQYpFeiqsdiU-b4lg&oe=